{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T00:26:34+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Legends of Savvarah: Time of Pariah", "steam_appid": 2416500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [2949830, 3098620], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Game from the &quot;Legends of Savvarah&quot; series.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Time of Pariah&quot; is an interactive story. The game is primarily text-based, but with lots of illustrations (essentially a visual novel in a non-standardised setting).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the continent of Erteon, the endless war rages between Kradzhan – an alliance of three beastly kingdoms – and Dominion of the Horned Ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seihal is a port city of Kradzhan, steeped in corruption and crime. Wealthy aristocrats, commanding squads of well-armed mercenaries, wield the ultimate power here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidu is a mercenary. He once deserted the army, escaping death. He managed to blend into this colorful cauldron of the criminal world, where a precarious balance between different factions has somehow been maintained in recent years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But now, this delicate balance is under threat: one by one, the enforcers of the Black Horn – a criminal authority for whom Hidu works – are disappearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidu must get to the bottom of these events. And perhaps even play a pivotal role in them, for a great storm is brewing...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Extra:</u></i> it is recommended to select the second launch option if the DLC is downloaded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complex and truly nonlinear plot: 25unique endings, numerous unexpected twists, and challenging decisions;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 detailed non-playable characters, each can become either your friend or foe;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 romantic interests (2 male and 3 female): 4 main and 1 additional;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant and unique visual style, original soundtrack;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A detailed, original fantasy world that goes beyond the game storyline;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space for role-play and your unique story: play as a ruthless rogue, a patriot of your country, or someone who just wants to survive. Everything is in your hands.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Game from the &quot;Legends of Savvarah&quot; series.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Time of Pariah&quot; is an interactive story. The game is primarily text-based, but with lots of illustrations (essentially a visual novel in a non-standardised setting).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the continent of Erteon, the endless war rages between Kradzhan – an alliance of three beastly kingdoms – and Dominion of the Horned Ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seihal is a port city of Kradzhan, steeped in corruption and crime. Wealthy aristocrats, commanding squads of well-armed mercenaries, wield the ultimate power here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidu is a mercenary. He once deserted the army, escaping death. He managed to blend into this colorful cauldron of the criminal world, where a precarious balance between different factions has somehow been maintained in recent years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But now, this delicate balance is under threat: one by one, the enforcers of the Black Horn – a criminal authority for whom Hidu works – are disappearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidu must get to the bottom of these events. And perhaps even play a pivotal role in them, for a great storm is brewing...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Extra:</u></i> it is recommended to select the second launch option if the DLC is downloaded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complex and truly nonlinear plot: 25unique endings, numerous unexpected twists, and challenging decisions;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 detailed non-playable characters, each can become either your friend or foe;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 romantic interests (2 male and 3 female): 4 main and 1 additional;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant and unique visual style, original soundtrack;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A detailed, original fantasy world that goes beyond the game storyline;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space for role-play and your unique story: play as a ruthless rogue, a patriot of your country, or someone who just wants to survive. Everything is in your hands.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "You are Hidu, a beastman mercenary in a port city. You must survive one very bad day. How? That’s entirely up to you. There are countless ways for events to unfold — and 25 endings.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416500/617e4121171d37d8dfa498647aaadb2250f96d3b/header.jpg?t=1775658697", "capsule_image"